    H(14120, 14281, "CHANNEL LORE / WWAM UP IN YA", "THE INTERNET SHOULD HAVE KILLED WWAM IN 2016, BUT THE COCKROACHES KEEP WALKING // CHANNEL MANIFESTO", "The hosts describe WWAM as the alternative to an algorithmic movie guy who only tells you whether a film sucks. The internet was supposed to kill the channel years ago; the cockroaches keep walking. That is a mission statement, not filler.")
